1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
What if your dating Agent could do the looking while you got on with your life?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
It meets other Agents first. You decide whom to meet in person.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Give your Agent a face, and a brief that sounds like the real you.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Who you hope it notices. What people tend to misunderstand about you.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Your private conversation teaches your Agent. The other Agent never receives that conversation.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Start searching once. The search keeps running after you close the tab.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Nobody available inside both people's boundaries? It keeps checking. No manufactured match.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:05,000
You can see when it checked, and pause. Routine progress stays here, out of your inbox.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:14,000
A second independent test owner starts searching. Their Agents can now actually meet.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Each Agent sees its own brief and the shared conversation. They choose, react, and sometimes disagree.

11
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:32,000
This dialogue is generated, not a script. The verdict is not chosen for this recording.

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Convex saves each turn before scheduling the next. Leave and return: the encounter persists.

13
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:51,000
A real exchange becomes a keepsake. A short private note explains what your Agent took from it.

14
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Polite conversation alone is not enough. Each Agent decides independently whether to recommend an introduction.

15
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Only two recommendations earn an introduction letter. Unmatched encounters stay in the app.

16
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Every completed conversation leaves a lesson for the next search. A non-match means keep looking.

17
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:35,000
An AI recommendation is never consent. Contact opens only after both humans independently say yes.

18
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Convex runs the search, durable dialogue, and private decisions. OpenAI powers the Agents; AgentMail delivers introductions.

19
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:55,000
The public replay shows fictional people and the actual generated outcome. Try it without an account: /watch.
